ution "We will make use of the following chain rule formula:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂w}{∂y}=\\frac{∂w}{∂r}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +\\frac{1}{r}\\frac{∂w}{∂\\theta }\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives of $w$ with respect to $r$ and $\\theta :$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂w}{∂r}=1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta ,\\,\\frac{∂w}{∂\\theta }=2r\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, substituting these into our chain rule formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂w}{∂y} & =(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta )\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +\\frac{1}{r}(2r\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta +2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186125247 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7a5455a6-a620-598c-ad7d-fe4df9304006" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186478739} {:answer/id #uuid "be832724-0d5c-5c12-8cac-57e9d7fe56e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186478866} {:answer/id #uuid "c7e0ff91-463d-5009-a863-3db111e986e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186478879} {:answer/id #uuid "cae67d8e-975c-57a3-acb6-aea452effb82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186478883} {:answer/id #uuid "ed302be1-425e-5d43-9c40-6e14e1503e1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186478927}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c7e0ff91-463d-5009-a863-3db111e986e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/